    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link DiscordianDate#until(java.time.chrono.ChronoLocalDate)}, which returns the period (years, months, days) elapsed between two Discordian dates. <p> In the Discordian calendar a date is written as (year, month, day-of-month) where months run 1..5 and days 1..73. The special value (year, 0, 0) denotes St. Tib's Day, a day that belongs to no month and is inserted in leap years."
